          "delivery": "Email is log-only in this deployment: the report is generated and handed to notification.LogEmailService, which records the recipients, subject, filename and size in the server log instead of sending. Replace the NewLogEmailService call in cmd/server/main.go with an SMTP-backed EmailService to deliver for real.",
          "enabled": true,
          "summary": "Schedules run on the server's cron engine: each run executes the saved report and renders it to CSV."
